4561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> And quite frankly, I find maintaining a &quot;nuWW is out to RUIN EVERYTHING!!!&quot; as being completely draining and unproductive mentality to have. It ain't healthy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Your words chief. &quot;Just because i'm telling you what your views are and saying they are the product of an unhealthy mentality doesn't mean I'm saying you are mentally unhealthy, just your views!&quot; Is certainly interesting.<br /> <br /> I do appreciate that we're done with the peak Internet of picking out a post that had nothing to do with you, mocking it, mocking the poster, arguing at length that you had every right to in response to that going unappreciated for some mysterious reason, then some more insults. Demanding all the while that not accepting the added aspect of &quot;you're not responding to me productively to dare to point out the insults&quot; is the height of unreason. <br /> <br /> Aaanywho, I sure do hope the content of that larp goes largely ignored as far as potential thematic influence for nuww fae, presuming this means I'm allowed to say that again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 08-10-2018, 08:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}